      "behaviour": "Bit 0 enables memory-to-memory transfers, bit 1 holds channel 0's address, bit 2 disables the controller, bit 3 selects compressed timing, bit 4 rotating priority, bit 5 extended write, bit 6 makes DREQ active low, bit 7 makes DACK active high.",
